WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.600
Two war rooms have already reported: a supplier shutdown, and a plant incident. The Cross-Domain Cascade room loads both, and asks what they mean together. What follows is a simulated incident.

2
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:30.600
Six engines read across both cases. A supplier failure on turbine housings meets reduced capacity on Line Three, and the combined buffer is under nine days. Exposure runs from one point four to two point six million dollars. The risk score is seventy-nine out of one hundred.

3
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:45.600
The Operations Strategist receives the cascade alongside the supplier and plant cases behind it.

4
00:00:45.600 --> 00:01:00.600
The Executive Portal shows the decision that protects the line: qualify an alternate castings supplier within three days, for ninety thousand dollars. The system recommends. A person decides.

